[{"id":559726514,"node_id":"MDEyOkxhYmVsZWRFdmVudDU1OTcyNjUxNA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/events/559726514","actor":{"login":"bebraw","id":166921,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2NjkyMQ==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/166921?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw","html_url":"https://github.com/bebraw","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bebraw/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"event":"labeled","commit_id":null,"commit_url":null,"created_at":"2016-02-22T14:38:36Z","label":{"name":"bug","color":"fc2929"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/187218012","html_url":"https://github.com/webpack/webpack/issues/2084#issuecomment-187218012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/2084","id":187218012,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDE4NzIxODAxMg==","user":{"login":"micschro","id":9990291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5OTAyOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9990291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro","html_url":"https://github.com/micschro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2016-02-22T14:56:25Z","updated_at":"2016-02-22T15:36:27Z","body":"This seems to be a serious problem, because not only does the `thisArg` binding\nnot work, but using a require callback like `require([],function(){}.bind(this))`\nalso causes webpack to ignore any nested requires:\n\n``` javascript\nrequire([], function() {\n  require([], function() {\n  });\n}.bind(this));\n```\n\nis transformed like this:\n\n``` javascript\n!/* require */(/* empty */function() { var __WEBPACK_AMD_REQUIRE_ARRAY__ = []; (function() {\n  require([], function() {\n  });\n}.bind(this).apply(null, __WEBPACK_AMD_REQUIRE_ARRAY__));}());\n```\n\ni.e., the nested require isn't \"webpacked\" at all.\n\nLooking at the code in `AMDRequireDependenciesBlockParserPlugin.js`,\nit seems like the AMD Plugin processes only require callbacks of type\n\"FunctionExpression\":\n\n``` javascript\nif(expr.arguments[1].type === \"FunctionExpression\") {\n ...\n this.walkStatement(expr.arguments[1].body);\n}\n```\n\nHowever, if a bind expression is used, `expr.arguments[1].type` is actually a\n\"CallExpression\". \n\nA possible workaround is to to create a local variable for `this` instead of using `bind(this)`:\n\n``` javascript\nvar that = this;\nrequire([], function() {\n  that.foo();\n});\n```\n\nBut that means we would have to adapt a lot of code to make our project work with webpack,\nwhich I think wouldn't go well with the basic idea of webpack.  \n\nThis might be a duplicate of #1234, but I think the fact that the bind expression \ncauses nested `require`s to be ignored really aggravates the problem.  \n","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/comments/187218012/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"micschro","id":9990291,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjk5OTAyOTE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/9990291?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro","html_url":"https://github.com/micschro","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/micschro/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"id":560052415,"node_id":"MDExOkNsb3NlZEV2ZW50NTYwMDUyNDE1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/webpack/webpack/issues/events/560052415","actor":{"login":"sokra","id":1365881,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEzNjU4ODE=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1365881?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra","html_url":"https://github.com/sokra","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sokra/subscri